// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Item Var Name - INTRODUCTION_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1351032648" "There's a story here about Black Scorpion, one of Lord Recluse's lieutenants, looking for a 'stolen' data slug. He's something of a tech junkie, but he's also careless and more than a little stupid. Reading between the lines, you think he might have lost one of his power armor's data slugs. The information recorded on that storage device could be priceless."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3526428549" "The {VillainGroup} hit a Crey facility last night. Something about a high-tech neural scrambler. Might be a good idea to boost it before Crey gets it back."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3774695353" "Information. That's the most valuable resource of all. Seems the {VillainGroup} have stumbled onto some very valuable knowledge, but they don't know it yet. They moved into an old hideout and found where someone had been making fake IDs a while back. A contact of yours has coded a secret message into an article telling you they actually have the real ID cards the clients had thrown away. One of them in particular is worth something, but your source won't say why. Fetch it and he'll let you in on the secret."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1796095819" "The {VillainGroup} have been hacking Aeon Corp's files from a remote location. You just happen to know where that remote location is. Get their codes and you can show them what hacking really means."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P190586450" "The {VillainGroup} developed some new weapon tech. They've already done some marketing for you, now it's up to you handle 'procurement.'"
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3633430200" "The {VillainGroup} stole a new microchip prototype from Portal Corp a few days ago. If you were to take it from them, it'd be easy to sell on the black market."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3400562156" "The {VillainGroup} have been getting under your skin lately. This lead would let you raid one of their bases and get a list of their stooges. Then you can think about wiping out the whole lot. Best get there quick before they vacate."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3113175604" "A source contacts you via coded message in the Rogue Isle Protector. She wants some information off one of the {VillainGroup}'s computers. She's offering a generous reward if you take the job."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P148599163" "The {VillainGroup} have been doing some research. Something about coral from those freaks you find on the beaches. Some friends of yours would pay handsomely to find out what they've discovered. Of course, the {VillainGroup} aren't likely to share without a little--persuasion."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2054049733" "The {VillainGroup} are on a roll. Smashing their enemies and knocking capes around like school kids. Word is they've been processing a new form of superadine that helps them fight without any of the side-effects. A sample would be worth a fortune."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P319013080" "Someone has placed a hidden message in your latest copy of the newspaper. It reads: Once upon a time there was a design for a computer that could actually interface with Rikti tech. It was scrapped when the fools couldn't figure out how to make it work, but a certain white-haired genius in Cap au Diable would like to see how far they got. Break in to the {VillainGroup} hideout, find the prototype and you'll be well-rewarded."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2888462189" "The {VillainGroup} are working on a new metal that weighs half as much as steel but is twice as strong. Steal some steel and see who's interested in buying it."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P474757218" "Formula 13. You've heard rumors about it. Some say it gives you super strength. Some say it lets you walk through walls. Some say it simply unlocks whatever inherent mutations you already have. You just know it's worth a fortune. Your dear friends the {VillainGroup} seem to have some. For now."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1269776546" "A message has been inserted into your newspaper. It reads: When Captain Mako tore apart Scrapyard a few years back, he suffered more than a few hits from the hero's hammer. One of his teeth got knocked out and a local wharf rat grabbed it and sold it to the {VillainGroup}. Mako wants his tooth back, and thinks you're the guy to fetch it. I highly recommend you complete this little errand for us. Mako isn't exactly a patient fellow."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P405133580" "What weighs three ounces and comes in a box? You have no idea, but the {VillainGroup} stole it so it must be worth something."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P522208277" "The {VillainGroup} seem to have a toy that lets them intercept and decode satellite signals. That would be quite handy for tracking one's enemies."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1223540472" "The {VillainGroup} have been working on new weapons you think you could dump for a few bucks. Should be a simple smash and grab."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3949937380" "A bunch of jokers from the {VillainGroup} hit a high-tech research firm in Paragon City, then came back here to sell whatever they took. It shouldn't be too hard to take it from them before they find a buyer and sell it yourself."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3806127691" "Rumors of the Bank Gun have circulated for weeks. It's a one-shot weapon designed to take out bank vault doors with an electronic burst of data that overwhelms the electronics and forces the door to open itself. Somehow your friends the {VillainGroup} got one of these devices and you'd love to have it almost as much as you'd enjoy taking it from them."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2794676666" "Information is often more valuable than gold. The {VillainGroup} just happen to have eavesdropped on certain officials of Arachnos. You'd bet your next hangover lasts longer than these guys once Arachnos finds out what they did. You figure you can profit off their misfortune by grabbing their tapes, selling whatever's on them, and then washing your hands of the whole thing before Arachnos finds out."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3540233786" "Diamonds. The {VillainGroup} just stole some. These impure stones aren't particularly valuable in the traditional sense, but they're near priceless for things like lasers and other death rays. And you know how your friends here in the isles like to build their death rays. Bogart the gems and you'll make a fortune the next time you hear of a mad scientist with a doomsday device in need of crystals."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3933208255" "One of the {VillainGroup} happens to be an inventor. He created some kind of new storage device they call a 'superslug.' Word is it's patentable. You could crush this little Dr. Peabody's dreams by taking his prototypes and plans and selling them to a rival. It isn't nice, but neither are you."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P707102680" "The {VillainGroup} have been gathering information lately on high-tech firms. You suspect they're about to build some kind of new device from the collective parts. You want to know what their plans are so you can decide if you want to use it or sell it."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2048994494" "You like knowing what everyone is up to, and the {VillainGroup} have been unusually tight-lipped lately. You decide to do a little information gathering by breaking into one of their hideouts you know about and seeing what they're up to. It won't hurt to smash a few heads while you're there to keep them humble."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1441600698" "The {VillainGroup} just stole some gizmos from Cook's Electronics. Nothing spectacular, but worth a few bucks with the right contacts. And of course, you have the right contacts."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1066206408" "The {VillainGroup} unleashed a nasty email virus on the Rogue Isles in a classic blackmail scam. You just happen to know where one of their labs is. If you can fight your way to their computer system, you can copy the virus' source code and sell it for a bundle."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2405164008" "The famous Johnny Sonata sings at the Golden Giza in St. Martial. Whether you like his music or not, someone got a studio cut of his new CD and it's worth a fortune to music pirates. A friend of yours mentioned the {VillainGroup} might be the ones responsible. Time to pay them a visit and see if they sing."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1157760247" "According to your sources, Pyle was a reporter during World War II. He mostly worked the Italian front. For some reason, the moment his name surfaced in the paper a bunch of creeps from the {VillainGroup} raided his house. They took something and told the surviving family to keep quiet or they'd be back. But you found out about it, and you want to know what they were after."

