// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Item Var Name - ITEM_DESCRIPTION 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2115761454" "It's a gig or two of information on a data storage device, including audio and video of Black Scorpion going about his daily routine. Definitely good blackmail material, and a quick buck."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4250537264" "Looks like a high-tech egg-beater to you."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1566215797" "Carl Egon. Hmm. You call your contact and he says only that he was some crazed inventor who kept burning down his labs a few years back. You're about to make him tell you more when the line suddenly goes dead."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3126965577" "NOGELARC. What kind of a code is that? And why would it provide such an easy backdoor into Aeon Corps' mainframe? Ah well. Who cares? You're getting paid and that's all that matters."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2987364395" "Ah. A Rikti weapon. Not truly experimental tech, but it should fetch a few bucks at least."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2518435668" "The chip is labeled 'tp jammer'. Wonder what it's supposed to jam? Toilet paper? Cruel, but hardly effective."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1672904301" "Hey! Your favorite high school teacher has joined the bad guys. Guess he was right when he said you didn't play well with others."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2320257305" "Looks like electrical readings from Cap au Diable. What could be so important about that? Hmm. Looks like there are weird spikes every 666 seconds."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4165174627" "Little pieces of coral on slides or in petri dishes. How exciting. You spit in one just to screw up the egghead who analyzes it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P644599118" "Looks like the same old junk to you."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P775806880" "Hmm. An impressive piece of electronic engineering. Still, you bet the guy who came up with it can't set the clock on his DVD player."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3259448423" "Hey, it is pretty light. Tough too. You can definitely see some uses for this."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2875909317" "Formula 13 might be potent, but it smells like sweat socks."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2015440119" "That is one big freaking tooth. You'd hate to feel a mouthful of these."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1452523972" "In the box is a human finger. Maybe they wanted it for the DNA. Hmm. Wonder who 'Webb' is?"
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P219350527" "This thing weighs a ton. But you'll manage."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3630400991" "Looks like some kind of neural disruptor. You pull the trigger but nothing happens. Stupid prototypes."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4197183646" "Interesting. It's a package full of very common chips, like you mind find in alarm clocks, cell phones, and so on. Obviously someone has plans to alter them for some more nefarious purpose."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4020782629" "An interesting idea, but it looks like the gun isn't currently functioning. Ah well, it'll still be worth something to the right problems."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2941445474" "It's best not to play it. You can always deny having heard it, but those creepy Fortunatas seem to be able to read minds, so you decide just to sell the thing and be rid of it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P331713343" "Hello, beauties. These diamonds are huge. Flawed, but huge. You gotta think they'd look better as bling than powering some oversized doomsday device though."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2041955461" "It's a complicated schematic. There don't seem to be any prototypes of the device around."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P674025577" "Hmm. They've been gathering info on companies researching orbital lasers and satellite positioning systems. Could be they're looking to pull the classic blackmail routine on Paragon City. Not that you care, but you'd rather make a profit off their research than set back and read about it in the papers."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P691432198" "Their lull seems to have more to do with getting smashed by mugs like you more than any grand scheme. You find a long list of their gang's names--all coded, no doubt--with lines through them."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2705740497" "Wireless ethernet cards, copies of some superhero MMO (as if!), and a couple of new graphics cards. Not a bad haul, considering."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P783017257" "That was easy. Selling a disk is a lot easier than selling a priceless work of art or painting. And you can sell it over and over again."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P941887635" "The moment you place your hands on the CD you see smoke. To your amazement, the thing bursts into flames and crumbles to ash. What the devil was THAT about?"
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P84839865" "The box is full of keepsakes from a reporter who served in WWII. He died recently and these notes were discovered by his grandson. In it is an interview with none other than Lord Recluse himself, and a note on the side that says 'Stefan Richter.' Could that be Recluse's real name?"
// Script Variable INTERACT_ACTION_STRING :
"P1469950025" "Searching..."
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P2523319180" "Get {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P862497936" "You'll pay for violating our sanctum, {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P338096845" "There's {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P3071390145" "Attack!"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P370853995" "Make the intruder pay!"
// Script Variable RETURNED_STRING :
"P2382769841" "So, you got it, huh? Gotta admit, you're tougher than you look. Here's your payment."
// Script Variable RETURNED_STRING :
"P848921745" "You're back. And you got it. I thought you'd skipped town on me."
// Script Variable RETURNED_STRING :
"P891308232" "Color me surprised. You did it."
// Script Variable RETURNED_STRING :
"P3782265526" "Crud. I bet a grand you wouldn't make it back in one piece."
// Script Variable RETURNED_STRING :
"P818783243" "That wasn't so hard now, was it?"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P5974919" "I hear {VillainName} stole  {ITEM_NAME}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P782625694" "Last I heard, {VillainName} had {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P2707524139" "WSPDR had a story about {VillainName} stealing {ITEM_NAME} right out from under the {VillainGroup}'s noses."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1005151371" "WSPDR said {VillainName} stole {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1618758224" "Wow! {VillainName}! The thief who stole {ITEM_NAME}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P107187446" "Shh! That's {VillainName}. You hear about the {ITEM_NAME}? Daaaang."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3762774050" "I hear someone's been spreading rumors about our find."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2956467389" "Once we've figured out how to make this scheme work, destroy {ITEM_NAME}. I don't want anyone else getting hold of it."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1186059862" "The sooner we're rid of {ITEM_NAME}, the better."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P40811131" "Word on the street is that {VillainName} is on the way to steal {ITEM_NAME}. Let's make sure we're ready."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P757355753" "Double the guards. I hear {VillainName} was seen in the neighborhood."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1368603554" "What have we learned about {ITEM_NAME} so far?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P547426632" "All this trouble for {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2971175671" "If anyone so much as knocks on our door, kill them. I must not be disturbed."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2414713132" "Have you finished with {ITEM_NAME} yet?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3937009461" "I don't care about heroes. Capes I can handle. It's our fellow villains who worry me. Especially {VillainName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P476472103" "You dolt! Look what you've done to {ITEM_NAME}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1451766999" "You idiot! You've ruined it!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1157970515" "Luring {VillainName} here is all part of my plan, fool. I planned for ALL of this! Now defeat {VillainName} while I exit through the back door to complete my ingenius plan."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2989356918" "Protect {ITEM_NAME}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3350725194" "Kill {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P528966528" "NO! You will not have {ITEM_NAME}. It's mine, mine, mine!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3320594388" "Keep your filthy hands off {ITEM_NAME}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P289378890" "You will regret the day you crossed {VillainGroup}, {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P472878405" "You want {ITEM_NAME}? Come and get it."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1018387041" "So you found us, {VillainName}. Too bad for you."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2345426807" "{VillainName}? How did you--never mind. You're dead meat now."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3634089380" "Wait {VillainName}. Maybe we can make a deal? You can't take all of us. No? Fine. You'll regret it."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2713522501" "{VillainName}? Parlay! Parlay!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1821626560" "{VillainName}! Hah! You've walked right into my, er, trap. I'll let you live if you, er, leave now. <em>Please?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3878666536" "I'm sure we can settle this without violence. <em>Kidding. Let's rumble."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1528558846" "All this trouble over {ITEM_NAME}. Hardly seems worth it. But at least you get to bust some heads."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P103044850" "They call this high-tech? You've seen more sophisticated alarms at Cooke's Electronics."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3305104391" "Mmmm. Smashing time."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3173917571" "This never gets old. Whacking rivals and selling off their stuff."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P4230297253" "Another bloody adventure lies ahead. You hope Lord Recluse is paying attention. One day you'll be breaking bones for Arachnos."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3398943451" "It's quiet in here. Maybe the {VillainGroup} heard your big, bad self was coming and beat it."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1940690306" "No guards at the door. Smart. Not that it would have mattered, but still."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3140450959" "Why is it no one ever stations guards at the door? Don't they know this is a city of villains?"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P4106381115" "You crack your knuckles and stretch your back. It's just another day at the office for you."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3805192576" "'{VillainName} is here! Anybody want a piece o' me!'"
// Script Variable ACCEPT_STRING :
"P417990872" "Steal {ITEM_NAME} from the {VillainGroup}."

